  <info><title>Getting started</title></info>
  <section xml:id="install">
    <title>Install</title>
    <para>Run the <emphasis role="strong">installer</emphasis>, then read <xref linkend="config"/>.<footnote><para>Admin rights needed.</para></footnote></para>
    <programlisting language="sh">./install.sh --prefix /opt</programlisting>
    <para>Type <userinput>yes</userinput> when asked.</para>
